<title>USA: Mirage Resorts Inc Q1 shr falls to $0.29.</title>
<headline>Mirage Resorts Inc Q1 shr falls to $0.29.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>March 31, 1997     Q1    March 31, 1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.29		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net			 54,464		   64,587</p>
<p> Revs		     394,399		  374,208</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     190,532		  195,694</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 First Call mean estimate was $0.31</p>
<p>Q1 1997 includes a charge of $2.2 million, or $0.01/shr, for early debt retirement, offset by a $2.4 million, or $0.01/shr, gain for the sale of land in Las Vegas.  </p>
<p>Q1 1996 includes a gain of $5.2 million, or $0.03/shr, for the sale of a casino in Argentina.</p>
